sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Citizen
    participant UI as WhatsApp / Web UI
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant LLM as Claude Sonnet
    participant TPL as Template Engine
    participant PAY as Razorpay
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    User->>UI: Generate a consumer complaint
    UI->>API: POST /api/document/generate

    API->>API: Extract context from conversation history

    API->>LLM: Generate document fields from context
    LLM-->>API: Complainant respondent facts sections

    API->>TPL: Select template + fill fields
    TPL-->>API: Draft document Markdown

    API->>UI: Preview document
    UI->>User: Review and edit draft
    User->>UI: Approves document

    alt Paid document Rs 49-499
        API->>PAY: Create Razorpay order
        PAY-->>API: Order ID + payment link
        API->>UI: Payment prompt
        UI->>User: Razorpay payment page
        User->>PAY: Completes payment UPI or Card
        PAY->>API: Webhook payment success
    end

    API->>TPL: Render final PDF
    TPL-->>API: PDF document

    API->>S3: Store PDF
    S3-->>API: Download URL

    API->>DB: Log doc type user payment
    API->>UI: Download link
    UI->>User: Document ready for download
